{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/gkishanreddy/videos/every-family-deserves-the-assurance-of-financial-protection-against-unforeseen-c/1727225471797855/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/gkishanreddy/videos/every-family-deserves-the-assurance-of-financial-protection-against-unforeseen-c/1727225471797855/","title":"10K views · 158 reactions | \"Every family deserves the assurance of financial protection against unforeseen circumstances.\n\nThrough the 𝐏𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐡𝐚𝐧 𝐌𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐢 𝐒𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐤𝐬𝐡𝐚 𝐁𝐢𝐦𝐚 𝐘𝐨𝐣𝐚𝐧𝐚, with an 𝐚𝐧𝐧𝐮𝐚𝐥 𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐮𝐦 𝐨𝐟 𝐣𝐮𝐬𝐭 ₹𝟐𝟎, crores of citizens are receiving accident insurance cover of ₹2 lakh, bringing security and confidence to millions of households.\n\nI encourage everyone to share information about this scheme so that every eligible person can avail its benefits.\"\n\n— Hon'ble PM Shri @narendramodi in #MannKiBaat | Kishan Reddy Gangapuram","description":"\"Every family deserves the assurance of financial protection against unforeseen circumstances.\n\nThrough the 𝐏𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐡𝐚𝐧 𝐌𝐚𝐧𝐭𝐫𝐢 𝐒𝐮𝐫𝐚𝐤𝐬𝐡𝐚 𝐁𝐢𝐦𝐚 𝐘𝐨𝐣𝐚𝐧𝐚, with an 𝐚𝐧𝐧𝐮𝐚𝐥 𝐩𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐢𝐮𝐦 𝐨𝐟 𝐣𝐮𝐬𝐭 ₹𝟐𝟎, crores of citizens...","language":"en","text":"During the latter half of October, I attended the International Mining and Resources Conference 2026 (IMARC) in Australia, held bilateral meetings, explored emerging technologies in the minerals and mining sector, and interacted with members of the Indian diaspora.\nIn Hyderabad, I joined the Bathukamma and Dasara celebrations, with the magnificent 72-foot-tall Bathukamma at Amberpet, crafted by the DEWI Organisation using a variety of flowers, being a special highlight.\nThese engagements reflect a continued focus on strengthening India's mineral security and international partnerships, while remaining deeply connected to 🇮🇳's cultural heritage.\nSharing some glimpses:","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":9513.842692999959,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}